{"estimated_tokens":456,"version":"0.1.0","entries":["auth/session"],"paths":[],"budget":900,"used":807,"full":4,"stubs":1,"omitted":4,"units":[{"id":"auth/session#requirements","doc":"auth/session","path":"docs/auth/session.md","type":"spec","status":"active","anchor":"requirements","heading":"Requirements","line":10,"tier":"entry","hash":"c45e6a10f2970c6b","chars":320,"mode":"full","text":"## Requirements\n\n- **expiry**: When a session expires, the gateway SHALL reject the request with status 401.\n- **renewal**: The session SHALL be renewed quickly, if possible.\n- **R-7**: While a session is active, the gateway SHALL refresh its expiry on each request.\n- **Bad_Key**: The gateway MUST log the session id."},{"id":"guides/logging#logging","doc":"guides/logging","path":"docs/guides/logging.md","type":"guide","status":"active","anchor":"logging","heading":"Logging","line":6,"tier":"applies","hash":"e819cae7e80b46c9","chars":74,"mode":"full","text":"# Logging\n\nLog every rejected request with its request id and the reason."},{"id":"auth/tokens#requirements","doc":"auth/tokens","path":"docs/auth/tokens.md","type":"spec","status":"deprecated","anchor":"requirements","heading":"Requirements","line":7,"tier":"depends","hash":"120b874381208450","chars":162,"mode":"stub"},{"id":"auth/tokens#tokens","doc":"auth/tokens","path":"docs/auth/tokens.md","type":"spec","status":"deprecated","anchor":"tokens","heading":"Tokens","line":5,"tier":"depends","hash":"6860bfc09e21e7a5","chars":10,"mode":"full","text":"# Tokens"},{"id":"ADR-1-session-store#session-store","doc":"ADR-1-session-store","path":"docs/decisions/ADR-1-session-store.md","type":"decision","status":"accepted","anchor":"session-store","heading":"Session store","line":4,"tier":"decision","hash":"6c84b3751c541aa2","chars":17,"mode":"full","text":"# Session store"}]}
